== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From ''[[fjörutíu]]'' meaning "[[forty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[níu]]'' "[[nine]]". Meaning '''forty and nine'''.
=== Cardinal number ===

'''fjörutíu og níu''' {{indecl}}

# [[forty-nine]], cardinal number after [[fjörutíu og átta]] and before [[fimmtíu]]

